# Files Omarchy owns and patches in place on update.
# chezmoi must not deploy these, or `chezmoi apply` silently reverts
# upstream improvements delivered by omarchy migrations.
# Personal settings for these live in a *personal.conf sourced afterwards.
#
# tmux.conf is NOT listed here: setup-lite.sh captures Omarchy's copy
# (already patched with the personal.conf source line) back into this repo,
# so chezmoi deploys the exact same tmux.conf on every OS.
